      "value": "Also think about how it's convinient, to talk with your friends anywhere in the world about the world purchases anywhere in the world and ebing able to look at them and buy them, without having to go to a specific place in the world.\n\nThe specific place can be occupied by other people, you might not wanna move because you are comfortable or don't wanna move from your friends etc",
