  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-09-08T12:23:39.674Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "So currently you have to go the world itself, or go to a group page.\n\nPut an option to browse and buy stuff on the world page itself. It will make it easier for people to spend money on or browse what is available from the comfort of their menu.\n\nIt works both for marketing, generating revenue and generating traffic to the world.\n\nBenefits:\n\n- Display marketing\n\n- Conversion\n\n- Comfort and convinience for the users, browse from anywhere\n\nI say this as someone who has been in e-commerce for 10 years now, including the VRChat one, so this to me seems like a very simple thing that can help a lot.",
